| Axis                 | Meaning                                              |
| -------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |
| `parent`             | Direct parent                                        |
| `child`              | Direct children                                      |
| `ancestor`           | All parents above the element                        |
| `ancestor-or-self`   | Ancestors + current element                          |
| `descendant`         | All elements below                                   |
| `descendant-or-self` | Descendants + current element                        |
| `following-sibling`  | Elements after the current sibling                   |
| `preceding-sibling`  | Elements before the current sibling                  |
| `following`          | All elements appearing after current element in DOM  |
| `preceding`          | All elements appearing before current element in DOM |
| `self`               | Current element                                      |


//tag[@attribute='value']/axis::tag